            "created_at": "2025-09-03T00:45:30.335194+00:00",
            "notes": "If needed, sell everything to get  [Tranquilizer](item_2bea20a0-21c0-4a52-b81e-596c17d184b4).\n\nTranquilizer is huge utility as it vastly increases the effective range of sleep dart - you can use it to save yourself, save a teammate from far away, shoot a flyer out of the sky, interrupt an opponent's ultimate, knock someone down for your Reinhardt to charge and kill, etc. And every time you do you get 10 permanent health!\n\nOther than the upgraded sleep-dart utility, playstyle is still typical Ana... for now.",
