            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-03T00:45:30.335194+00:00",
            "notes": "Hopefully you've got at least 19k cash to get  [Potent Projectiles](item_7e9a8017-9458-4318-aea9-5e80ba7e3c46) and [Dash Boots](item_1ec670c7-a465-4ca0-9d16-aeeedab7894e).\n\nWith Dash Boots and a higher health pool than probably everyone else in the lobby (except the tanks), you can afford to get a lot closer to the action. That's where  [No Scope Needed](item_823db5eb-5a24-4bac-b850-0aa34e76b4f6) comes in.\n\n**Muscle memory for your fire rate can be tricky with the variable attack speed buff. Strong recommend for holding down the shoot button to maximize your fire rate when applicable. This is a weird thing to say as an Ana main but here I am.\n\n\n [Ammo Reserves](item_982d53aa-5ef4-493f-93e7-9e374d0ebf34) is a great optional pickup if you have the cash for it. This helps improve the viability of your attack speed buff as without them you'll be reloading a lot more often.\n\nIf you have more cash go for [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) or [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a).",
