            "created_at": "2025-09-03T00:45:30.335194+00:00",
            "notes": "If you've got enough cash to buy [Unscoped Resources](item_64c401f6-7508-4fc7-ac3a-93c9f3f57e2b) then you're in great shape. This item is excellent for the attack-speed build. With it you'll almost never run out of ammo and can keep your fire-rate buff up for a very long time while you dish out tons of healing and damage (don't forget to hold down the shoot button if that's helpful).\n\nSo anyway, I started blasting.\n\n\nIf you don't have enough cash for Unscoped Resources, [Ammo Reserves](item_982d53aa-5ef4-493f-93e7-9e374d0ebf34) will have to do for now.",
