            "created_at": "2025-09-03T00:45:30.335194+00:00",
            "notes": "[Pinpoint Prescription](item_5cfa07d8-7b5d-42df-a9a8-c6a580acb8bc) is an excellent addition to the build. You can get a lot of headshots with unscoped shots - especially with a high fire rate - but a quick zoom-in to hit a head can work wonders.\n\nStart stacking as much weapon power as you can afford with items like [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) and  [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) or [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124) if your team needs more healing.\n\n [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) is an excellent pickup as well as it provides a 15% improvement for only 4k cash.\n\nNow that you've got headshots [Quick Scope](item_c4ddab86-3ae0-4c5d-92ca-cead87dcec84) is a great option if you find yourself needing to zoom in a lot, especially for dealing with flyers.",
