            "notes": "The build is basically complete at this point, just start stacking as much weapon power and attack speed as you can.\n\nDepending on your cash situation (and how good you are at hitting your shots), you should consider selling [Potent Projectiles](item_7e9a8017-9458-4318-aea9-5e80ba7e3c46) at some point for more weapon power.\n\nYou can also consider selling [Dash Boots](item_1ec670c7-a465-4ca0-9d16-aeeedab7894e) for [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48) , but be mindful that this is still a decent hit to your mobility. So this choice will depend on the team/enemy comp and the map you're playing. You'll have a ton of health by now but a slow Ana is a vulnerable Ana; in later rounds of stadium opponents can do a lot of damage very quickly.",
